# W_MAP Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is git-ignored) and replace placeholder values.
# NEVER commit a real API key or private credential to Git.

# Server-side Google Maps Platform API key used by the local backend proxy
# (/api/google/places and /api/google/routes).
# Required Google Cloud APIs to enable:
#   1. Places API (New)  — https://places.googleapis.com/v1/places:searchText
#   2. Routes API        — https://routes.googleapis.com/directions/v2:computeRoutes
# Recommended Key Restrictions in Google Cloud Console:
#   - API Restrictions: Restrict key to "Places API (New)" and "Routes API"
#   - Application Restrictions: IP addresses (for server/proxy) or iOS Bundle ID (for native iOS app)
#   - Quota Controls: Set daily request caps on ComputeRoutes and SearchText to prevent unexpected billing.
GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_API_KEY_HERE
